.example</a>) has requested a budget increase in <strong>Acme Corp</strong>.</p><table class="lw-table" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;table-layout:fixed"><thead><tr><th class="lw-table-head" style="padding:0 12px 7px 0;text-align:right;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;white-space:nowrap">Spent so far</th><th class="lw-table-head" style="padding:0 12px 7px 0;text-align:right;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;white-space:nowrap">Current limit</th><th class="lw-table-head" style="padding:0 12px 7px 0;text-align:right;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;white-space:nowrap">Of the limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:right;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">$248.60</td><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:right;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">$250.00</td><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:right;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">99%</td></tr></tbody></table><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Scope</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">project</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Scope ID</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">project_KAXYxPR8MUgTcP8CF193y</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-muted" style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top">Period</td><td class="lw-text" style="padding:7px 0;font-size:13.5px;color:#141417;text-align:right">September 2026</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="lw-panel" style="margin:16px 0;padding:16px;background-color:#fdece0;border-radius:10px"><tbody><tr><td><p class="lw-panel-ink" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:#a83e05;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0"><strong>Message from Morgan Ellis</strong></p><p class="lw-panel-ink" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0;color:#a83e05;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">We are running the new support agent evaluation this week and it needs roughly double the usual headroom until Friday.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:26px 0"><tbody><tr><td><a class="lw-action" href="https://app.langwatch.ai/settings/budgets" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#141417;border:1px solid #141417;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-radius:999px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Review the budget</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:26px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">You are receiving this because you administer Acme Corp. You can reply straight to morgan@acme.example.</p><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0"><span style="font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em">LANGWATCH</span> <!-- -->·<!-- 