td><img class="lw-light-only" alt="LangWatch" height="27" src="https://app.langwatch.ai/images/logo.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:20px;color:#141417" width="112"/><img class="lw-dark-only" alt="LangWatch" height="27" src="https://app.langwatch.ai/images/logo-full-darktheme.svg" style="display:none;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:20px;color:#f5f4f1" width="112"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 24px"><tbody><tr><td class="lw-mesh" height="3" style="height:3px;line-height:3px;font-size:0;background-color:#ffcfa8;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff 0%, #ffaf6e 32%, #cddcf9 70%, #ffffff 100%);border-radius:2px"> </td></tr></tbody></table><p class="lw-eyebrow" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#f56b1a;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">ACCOUNT</p><h1 class="lw-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:&quot;Sentient&quot;, ui-serif, Georgia, &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#141417">Confirm your email address</h1><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Someone started creating a LangWatch account with this address (<strong>morgan@acme.example</strong>). Confirm it below to carry on.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:26px 0"><tbody><tr><td><a class="lw-action" href="https://app.langwatch.ai/auth/verify/ver_71c0aa93f5" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#141417;border:1px solid #141417;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-radius:999px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Confirm my email address</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 4px;color:#141417;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Your first trace</p><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Tracing a TypeScript application takes three lines.</p><pre class="lw-code" style="margin:12px 0 16px;padding:12px;background-color:#f6f5f4;border-radius:10px;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#141417;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal">npm install langwatch
<span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">import</span> { setupObservability } <span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">from</span> <span class="lw-tok-string" style="color:#0a6b46">&quot;langwatch/observability/node&quot;</span>;
<span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">await</span> <span class="lw-tok-call" style="color:#0a4fa3">setupObservability</span>();</pre><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Working in something else? <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Python</a> and<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/go/guide" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Go</a> have guides of their own.</p><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:18px 0 4px;color:#141417;font-weight:600;margin-top:18px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0">Or let your coding agent do it</p><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Add the LangWatch skills:</p><pre class="lw-code" style="margin:12px 0 16px;padding:12px;background-color:#f6f5f4;border-radius:10px;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#141417;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal"><span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">npx</span> skills add <span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">langwatch</span>/skills</pre><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Then paste this into your agent:</p><pre class="lw-code" style="margin:12px 0 16px;padding:12px;background-color:#f6f5f4;border-radius:10px;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#141417;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal">Install the LangWatch skills with <span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">npx</span> skills add <span class="lw-tok-keyword" style="color:#a83e05">langwatch</span>/skills, then instrument my code with LangWatch following the tracing skill. My API key is in LANGWATCH_API_KEY.</pre><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0"><a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/typescript/guide" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Open the quickstart</a> for every line here with a copy button.</p><p class="lw-text" style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;color:#141417;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">This link expires in 1 hour and can be used once. If this was not you, you can ignore this email: nothing has been created.</p><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:26px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0"><span style="font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em">LANGWATCH</span> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Documentation</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="mailto:support@langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">support@langwatch.ai</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

