th="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:24px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:24px;padding:10px 0;color:#141417;margin:0;font-weight:600;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">4,560,000 of 5,000,000 messages</p><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;height:8px;margin:10px 0 0"><tbody><tr><td style="width:91.2%;background-color:#f56b1a;border-radius:4px 0 0 4px;font-size:0;line-height:8px"> </td><td class="lw-code" style="width:8.799999999999997%;background-color:#f6f5f4;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;font-size:0;line-height:8px"> </td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class="lw-table" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;table-layout:fixed"><thead><tr><th class="lw-table-head" style="width:70%;padding:0 12px 7px 0;text-align:left;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;white-space:nowrap">Project</th><th class="lw-table-head" style="width:30%;padding:0 12px 7px 0;text-align:right;font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b5b5d;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;white-space:nowrap">messages</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:normal;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">Support agent</td><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:right;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">2,280,000</td></tr><tr><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:normal;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">Sales copilot</td><td class="lw-table-cell" style="padding:9px 12px 9px 0;text-align:right;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#141417;border-bottom:1px solid #e3e3e4;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap">2,280,000</td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:26px 0 16px"><tbody><tr><td><table border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding-right:0;vertical-align:middle"><a class="lw-action" href="https://app.langwatch.ai/settings/usage" style="line-height:20px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;padding:12px 24px;background-color:#141417;border:1px solid #141417;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border-radius:999px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:24px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:18" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">View usage details</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Most of the month is Support agent, at 2,280,000 messages. Start there.</p><p class="lw-muted" style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.55;margin:0 0 16px;color:#5b5b5d;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">You can move to a larger plan from the same page.</p><hr class="lw-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-top:1px solid #e3e3e4;margin:26px 0 18px"/><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0">You are receiving this because you administer Acme Corp.</p><p class="lw-subtle" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 6px;color:#727274;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:6px;margin-left:0"><span style="font-family:&quot;JetBrains Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &quot;SF Mono&quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &quot;Courier New&quot;, monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em">LANGWATCH</span> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="https://docs.langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">Documentation</a> <!-- -->·<!-- --> <a class="lw-link" href="mailto:support@langwatch.ai" style="color:#a83e05;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px" target="_blank">support@langwatch.ai</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
